{
  "rationale": "Use a small sensor plant plus a motion-command plant, then layer deterministic specifications that map sensed obstacle conditions to exactly one safe recovery action and bias clear conditions toward random_walk with occasional short move_forward progress. Commit/recovery states self-loop on path_clear so uncontrollables are processed first without preempting the intended one-shot action, while obstacle events still force safe recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate sensing and actuation into plant automata, then encode exploration policy in specifications.",
    "Use clear/search states for random_walk and short forward progress, obstacle-specific recovery states for backward/turn actions, and a rare full_rotate last-resort state only after repeated front blockage."
  ],
